<title>USA: Lucent backs forecast of double-digit growth.</title>
<headline>Lucent backs forecast of double-digit growth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc on Wednesday said it was sticking with forecasts of double-digit growth in earnings and revenue for 1997 and beyond.</p>
<p>&quot;We see no reduction in the rate,&quot; Richard McGinn, the company's president and chief operating officer, said at an investment conference.</p>
<p>He said earnings growth would outpace growth in revenues, though both rates would reach double digits.</p>
</text>
